From navigating the beauty industry to trusting their instincts, Denise Vasi and Tanya Gonzalez Chandhok get candid about the ambition and creativity it takes to build something of your own in our latest episode of Meet the Makers.

@denisevasi, founder of @maedbeauty, sits down with @tanyagabs, founder of @eausovert, to talk about showing up authentically, communicating your vision with confidence, and staying true to yourself as your business grows.

Presented by @toyotalatino, this campaign brings entrepreneurs together to share the perspective that comes from experience and creating space

